    "gpu": "NVIDIA RTX 5000 Ada Generation"
  },
  "tests": {
    "command": "python -m pytest -q",
    "passed": 656,
    "warnings": 5,
    "duration_seconds": 116.87,
    "sgp_specific_cases": 63,
    "checks": [
      "Independent sender-column matrices and every model/numerator/weighted packet/mass for four schedules, weight decay on/off, compute skew and global barriers",
      "Mass and numerator conservation at common logical iterations; no receiver-side renormalization",
      "Known changing stochastic oracle evaluated at z, updates applied to x without multiplying gradients by w",
      "Static irregular-graph averaging converges to the uniform origin average after debiasing despite nonuniform numerator limit",
      "Complete graph matches centralized equal-client-weight minibatch SGD; one client matches plain SGD",
      "Exact fused dense-numerator + 8-byte float64 mass traffic with header and round metadata",
      "Directed causal waiting: incoming peers required; slow outgoing recipient does not block unrelated incoming completion",
      "Small/arbitrary-size graphs, exponential finite-step averaging at powers of two, phase-specific incoming validation, duplicate guards",
      "Immutable inputs/local buffers, snapshots, duration stopping, seeded reproducibility, streaming and saved-DAG replay",
      "CPU/CUDA agreement for all model and numerator states; registry/settings/CLI and full maintained regressions"
    ]
  },
